<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Noise Reduction by Curvature</span></h1>
<hr align="left" width="98.974%" size="6" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from</span> <i style="font-style:normal;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Mesh &gt; Reduce Noise &gt; By Curvature</b></span></i><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p class="description"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span class="Command">Noise Reduction By Curvature</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command modifies the visible selection based on the local surrounding data and local curvature. Every point has a normal defined by the normals of the surrounding triangles. The curvature is described by the maximum angle between that normal and normals of the neighbour points (see</span> <u><span lang="EN-GB"><a href="Point_Curvature.htm">Point Curvature</a></span></u> <span lang="EN-GB">for details.) The smaller the curvature is, the flatter the surface is. The noise reduction is small if the curvature is high in order to keep the mesh features unchanged. So the noise will be mostly eliminated on a flat surface.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is grayed if there is no selection or all selections are hidden. It works on wholly selected entities as well as on partial selections.</span></p>
<p><img src="../images/noise_reduction_by_curvature.jpg" width="321px" height="199px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Strength</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Specifies how strong a filter to apply, i.e. number of iterations. It ranges from 1 to 40. Default values is = 1.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Maximum curvature to apply the filter</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">If the local curvature is greater than the given value, the filter is not applied in this area. Default values is 7 degrees</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
